  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "お疲れ様でした\r\n黛さん、今日めちゃくちゃよかったですよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "わあ、本当ですか……！？\r\nふゆ、すっごく嬉しいです……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "お仕事なのにこんなこと言っちゃダメかもですけど、\r\nちゃんと上手にできてるか、少し心配で……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "みなさんの期待に応えられていたなら、\r\n本当に本当によかったです……えへへ……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "そんなに不安がらなくても、\r\n黛さんはいつもバッチリですよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "スタッフ",
    "text": "次もよろしくお願いしますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010050,
