  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様、冬優子",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "スタッフさんたちみんな褒めてたぞ、\r\n『黛さんはいつも安定してる』って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──はぁ。そんなの当たり前でしょ\r\nふゆのこと誰だと思ってんのよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆはね、世界で一番可愛いアイドルになるの\r\nなるってもう決まってんの",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それなのに、現場で全然満足に動けてなかったら\r\n笑っちゃうでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……\r\nさすが、徹底してるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それも当たり前\r\nアイドルってのは、計算して作り上げるものなんだから",
    "charAnim1": "doubt",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "どんな時だって、誰に見られたって──",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "愛されるふゆでいられるように\r\n気を遣ってなきゃ嘘なの、わかる？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "それとも何？\r\nふゆのこと、そんなこともできないレベルだと思ってた？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まさか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "だったら、わかりきったこといちいち言ってこないで\r\n時間のムダでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "あんたはその分、もっともっとふゆを売り込むために\r\n頑張って営業でもしてきたらいいのよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "手厳しいな……\r\nでも冬優子の言うことももっともだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子が一番輝けるように、俺もプロデュース頑張るよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "shrug",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──そこで、俺から大事な話なんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "何？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0015",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400101401/4001014010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "前にした、ユニットを組むって話なんだけど\r\nぴったりなメンバーを見つけたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "３人ユニットで考えているんだが、まずはひとり",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今度紹介するから、楽しみにしていてくれ\r\n……すごいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001014010170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
